# `C98`. Identical to `services.config` plus three lines: one `defaults` header that every service
# gets, and one scoped to `second` alone (SPEC §3.2). Nothing else moves.

defaults
  header "X-Plant" is "c98-every-step"

env local default
  api "http://127.0.0.1:4507/base"
  api second "http://127.0.0.1:4507/second"
  header "X-Second" is "c98-second-only" for second
